      "text": "Role in teething:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " acetaminophen or ibuprofen if necessary; avoid teething gels (not effective; benzocaine can be dangerous in infancy)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
